1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,360
M: Hello, Ms. Mercer.

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:04,360
This is James Murdock from Speedy Auto Mechanics.

3
00:00:04,715 --> 00:00:06,480
The work on your vehicle has been completed.

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:08,020
W: That's excellent news.

5
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:13,940
Unfortunately, I'm going to be in meetings all day, so I can't pick it up until tomorrow.

6
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:18,460
M: If you give me your office address, I can have someone drop it off there.

7
00:00:18,915 --> 00:00:19,880
W: Would you do that for me?

8
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,000
I'd really appreciate it.

9
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,475
I work at 983 Emerson Lane.

10
00:00:25,105 --> 00:00:27,820
M: All right, your car should be there in around an hour.

11
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:30,240
I'll have the driver call you when he arrives.

12
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:31,080
W: Great.

13
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:34,540
And if he can give me the bill then, I'd appreciate it.
